This repository contains my solutions to the [100 NumPy Exercises](https://github.com/rougier/numpy-100/blob/master/100_Numpy_exercises.ipynb).

The goal of this project is to strengthen my understanding of NumPy by solving progressively challenging problems, covering topics such as array manipulation, broadcasting, and vectorized operations.

Each solution reflects my learning process and coding practices as I improve my skills in numerical computing with Python.
